## This repository

| Concern | Use |
|--------|-----|
| Charts | `lightweight-charts` (not Chart.js) |
| Server/client data | `@tanstack/react-query` |
| Auth / DB client | `@supabase/ssr`, `@supabase/supabase-js` |
| Generic React hooks | `usehooks-ts` (e.g. `useDebounceCallback`) before new global `hooks/*` |
| UI | `components/ui/*` (shadcn / radix) |
| Chart time labels | `Intl` via `app/(app)/trading-dashboard/_lib/chart/chart-timezone.ts` |
| Class names | `clsx` + `tailwind-merge` (`lib/utils.ts` `cn`) |

Do not re-add Chart.js, dayjs, or react-hook-form + zod unless a concrete feature needs them.
